mx - a minimal X11 terminal emulator.

Linux:
  deps: cairo fontconfig libxcb xcb-util-keysyms libxkbcommon freetype harfbuzz pkg-config
  make && ./bin/mx

OpenBSD:
  pkg_add cairo fontconfig libxcb xcb-util-keysyms libxkbcommon freetype harfbuzz
  make && ./bin/mx

Test: make test   (needs a UTF-8 locale, e.g. LC_CTYPE=en_US.UTF-8)

make USE_PANGO=0   builds without harfbuzz (plain FreeType glyphs, no shaping/ligatures).
